      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;COPHEX 코리아에서의 산업 연결과 혁신 
    &lt;div id=&#34;cophex-코리아에서의-산업-연결과-혁신&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#cophex-%ec%bd%94%eb%a6%ac%ec%95%84%ec%97%90%ec%84%9c%ec%9d%98-%ec%82%b0%ec%97%85-%ec%97%b0%ea%b2%b0%ea%b3%bc-%ed%98%81%ec%8b%a0&#34; aria-label=&#34;앵커&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
